@title EPISODE 04 • SUKI'S SECRET
@bg dorm_hallway_night
@show suki
Suki is crying in the stairwell. Suki never cries. Suki laughs too loud and borrows your lip gloss and never gives it back.
Suki: Don't. Don't be nice to me. I can't handle you being nice to me.
> [Sweet] Sit down next to her without a word. -> s_sweet
> [Bitchy] "Okay. Then I'll be mean. What did you do?" -> s_bitchy
> [Good] "Do you want me to get Jamal?" -> s_good
*s_sweet
@add Suki_Friendship 3
She leans on your shoulder. Five minutes. Ten. Then, quiet:
@jump s_done
*s_bitchy
@add Suki_Friendship 1
Suki laughs, wet and broken. "See, that's why I like you."
@jump s_done
*s_good
@add Suki_Friendship -1
Suki: NO. God, no. Not Jamal. Please.
*s_done
Suki: I kissed somebody at the Kappa party. Somebody who isn't Jamal.
London: Who?
Suki: ...Jayden.
London's stomach drops. Paris's Jayden. Mom's best friend's son. Heart-emoji Jayden.
> [Bold] "You have to tell Jamal. Tonight." -> t_bold
> [Bad] "Then nobody ever finds out." -> t_bad
> [Bitchy] "You kissed PARIS'S Jayden?" -> t_bitchy
> [Sweet] "Okay. We'll figure it out. Together." -> t_sweet
*t_bold
@add Suki_Friendship -1
@add Team_Reputation 1
Suki: You don't get it. Your life is perfect. Mine is held together with tape.
@jump t_done
*t_bad
@add Suki_Friendship 2
@add Secret_Kept 1
@add Paris_Friendship -1
You promise. It feels like swallowing a stone.
@jump t_done
*t_bitchy
@add Suki_Friendship -2
Suki: They're not even together! ...Are they?
London doesn't answer. That's the answer.
@jump t_done
*t_sweet
@add Suki_Friendship 2
